      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/grse-bel-defence-stocks-zoom-up-to-9-on-dac-nod-to-2-12-trn-proposals-126102700288_1.html" rel="noopener">BS Personal Finance</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
